PE 811: Bitwise Recursion / 按位递归

=== Problem Summary ===
b(n) = largest power of 2 dividing n
A(0) = 1
A(2n) = 3A(n) + 5A(2n - b(n))  for n > 0
A(2n+1) = A(n)
H(t, r) = A((2^t + 1)^r)

=== Verify small values ===
  A(81) = 636056 (expected 636056) ✓
  H(3, 2) = A(81) = 636056 = 636056 ✓

